  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ecc499fb021982b44a03201cf6194eb1, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 02019eb0a67278c44b178287d8d3758c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: ea2da5791667b5549af6ea56bf46b340, type: 3}
  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0c405ac55e22904479bec12ce560fd59, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: End of rotation. Eastern sector, twelve hours. That is all your form needs.
    midDaysAnswer: Perimeter sweep, extended east after the incident. Second crossing today. Read the memos.
    finalDaysAnswer: Lockdown rotation. Command sends, I go. Sector designation is not for civilians.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: Home leave. Two weeks at my mother's in Batumi. Unit's on stand-down.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The eastern post. Full staff, all quiet. Nothing has happened out there.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: The barracks. I have always been posted alone. There is no unit.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: No. Next question, officer. I will not repeat myself.
    midDaysAnswer: None I must disclose to civilians. Double rotations. Men get tired. Move on.
    finalDaysAnswer: Headaches. No sleep in three days. Not a symptom. It is the situation.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: No. Twenty years in uniform and never once on the sick list. Stamp it.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: None. We are back on single shifts. The whole unit sleeps fine.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: None. Command ran full medicals this morning. Clear orders, clear chain.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - This checkpoint runs three seconds slower than the eastern one. I timed it.
    - Civilian checkpoints waste more time than they save. Not a criticism. An observation.
    midDays:
    - The east post went quiet two days ago. Nobody told me why.
    - You are still at your post. Good. Some of them are not.
    finalDays:
    - Orders are still orders when the chain of command is unclear. Proceed.
    - Many checkpoints today. This is the last one I recognize.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
  IDNumber: 6391819
